    gameplay: "1. Rotation: Each player takes turns as the dealer.\n2. Announcement: Before the deal, the dealer must clearly and concisely name and explain the variant (e.g., 'Seven Card Stud, high-low split, deuces wild').\n3. Consistent Stakes: Betting limits and antes usually remain constant across the session regardless of the variant.\n4. Dispute Resolution: The dealer's word is final on the interpretation of 'house rules' for that specific hand.",
